Protocol implementation statement
---------------------------------

The wire protocol implemented in src/ was derived by observing the
input/output behaviour of the device under a mainstream desktop operating
system, solely for the purpose of interoperability — making an already
purchased device usable on Linux. No vendor specification, SDK, binary or
firmware was consulted, disassembled, linked or redistributed (clean-room
style implementation). Detailed engineering notes and capture data are
maintained outside this repository and are not part of this distribution.
No vendor firmware, images, fonts or data assets are redistributed here;
the device already contains its own boot animation and assets.
